#: ../../tools/reactome_content_tools.rst:32 18fb6d071b6e40cbb3290bd705ebccc9
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get all events (sub-pathways and reactions) contained "
"within a Reactome pathway. Decomposes a top-level pathway into its "
"complete hierarchy of sub-pathways and individual biochemical reactions. "
"Returns counts and lists of both pathways and reactions. Example: "
"R-HSA-109581 (Apoptosis) contains 177 events total: 4 major sub-pathways "
"(extrinsic, intrinsic, execution, regulation) plus 173 individual "
"reactions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/reactome_content_tools.rst:34
