#: ../../tools/reactome_content_tools.rst:61 93906c0e79b843b49870ad9e3cd2050d
msgid "**Name**: ``ReactomeContent_get_enhanced_pathway``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/reactome_content_tools.rst:63 f405232873f64031918c02cc4f342a2c
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get enhanced pathway details from Reactome including "
"description, literature references, GO biological process terms, and "
"direct sub-events. Provides richer information than basic pathway lookup "
"by including curated summaries, PubMed references, and Gene Ontology "
"annotations. Example: R-HSA-109581 (Apoptosis) returns a detailed "
"summation, GO:0006915 annotation, 4 sub-pathways (extrinsic, intrinsic, "
"execution, regulation), and key literature references."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/reactome_content_tools.rst:67 dbc18af7aefb4bbe97bb027df8024018
msgid ""
"``identifier`` (string) (required) Reactome pathway stable identifier. "
"Examples: 'R-HSA-109581' (Apoptosis), 'R-HSA-6804757' (Regulation of TP53"
" Degradation), 'R-HSA-69278' (Cell Cycle), 'R-HSA-168256' (Immune "
"System)."
msgstr ""

